{"page":721,"exact":true,"blocks":[{"x":0.60647,"y":0.05257,"w":0.34504,"h":0.01535,"fs":0.01535,"n":2,"t":"第12.1节 三维坐标系 707"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.09345,"w":0.59295,"h":0.02814,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"将二次方程视为平方的一次线性表达式。然后，从标准形式的方程中读出中心和半径。对于这里的球面，我们有"},{"x":0.53643,"y":0.13433,"w":0.2308,"h":0.01795,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"x^2 + y^2 + z^2 + 3x - 4z + 1 = 0"},{"x":0.53981,"y":0.15735,"w":0.23869,"h":0.01826,"fs":0.01401,"n":1,"t":"(x^2 + 3x) + y^2 + (z^2 - 4z) = -1"},{"x":0.40513,"y":0.1866,"w":0.10494,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"ax^2 + 3x + a^3"},{"x":0.50189,"y":0.1866,"w":0.01711,"h":0.03044,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"2b"},{"x":0.52065,"y":0.1866,"w":0.1938,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"2 b + y^2 + az^2 - 4z + a^-4"},{"x":0.70064,"y":0.1866,"w":0.02275,"h":0.03044,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"2 b"},{"x":0.72503,"y":0.1866,"w":0.10299,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"2b = -1 + a^3"},{"x":0.81984,"y":0.1866,"w":0.01711,"h":0.03044,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"2b"},{"x":0.83861,"y":0.1866,"w":0.05995,"h":0.02255,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"2 + a^(-4)"},{"x":0.88474,"y":0.1866,"w":0.02275,"h":0.03044,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"2b"},{"x":0.49112,"y":0.23008,"w":0.04873,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"ax + 3"},{"x":0.53166,"y":0.23008,"w":0.01711,"h":0.03044,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"2b"},{"x":0.55042,"y":0.23015,"w":0.19912,"h":0.02316,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"4 + 4 = 21/4"},{"x":0.74136,"y":0.23349,"w":0.08735,"h":0.02702,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"4 + 4 = 21/4"},{"x":0.36259,"y":0.26845,"w":0.59298,"h":0.04113,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"从这种标准形式中，我们可以看出 x0 = -3√2，y0 = 0，z0 = 2，并且 a = 2√2。中心是 (-3√2, 0, 2)。半径是 2√2。"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.33346,"w":0.59297,"h":0.02984,"fs":0.01407,"n":2,"t":"例 5 下面是一些关于球体中不等式和方程的几何解释。"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.36837,"w":0.58077,"h":0.03713,"fs":0.01279,"n":4,"t":"(a) x² + y² + z² ≥ 4 球体 x² + y² + z² = 4 的内部。 (b) x² + y² + z² ≤ 4 由球体 x² + y² + z² = 4 所界定的实心球。或者，球体 x² + y² + z² = 4 及其内部。 (c) x² + y² + z² > 4 球体 x² + y² + z² = 4 的外部。 (d) x² + y² + z² = 4，z ≤ 0 由 xy-平面（平面 z = 0）从球体 x² + y² + z² = 4 中切下的下半球面。"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.4029,"w":0.58077,"h":0.07166,"fs":0.01279,"n":6,"t":"Just as polar coordinates give another way to locate points in the xy-plane (Section 11.3), alternative coordinate systems, different from the Cartesian coordinate system developed here, exist for three-dimensional space. We examine two of these coordinate systems in Section 15.7."},{"x":0.62076,"y":0.47196,"w":0.33075,"h":0.01795,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"Exercises 12.1"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.52314,"w":0.59307,"h":0.05885,"fs":0.01279,"n":4,"t":"Equations and Geometric Interpretations 在练习 1–16 中，给出满足给定方程组的空间中点的集合的几何描述。"},{"x":0.08569,"y":0.63777,"w":0.17484,"h":0.02814,"fs":0.02814,"n":1,"t":"Exercises 12.1"},{"x":0.08775,"y":0.67629,"w":0.4159,"h":0.04015,"fs":0.01151,"n":3,"t":"方程的几何解释 在练习 1–16 中，给出满足给定方程组的空间中点的集合的几何描述。"},{"x":0.53926,"y":0.67642,"w":0.41587,"h":0.05422,"fs":0.01151,"n":4,"t":"不等式和方程的几何解释 在练习17-24中，描述满足给定不等式或方程与不等式组合的空间中点的坐标集合。"},{"x":0.09511,"y":0.72223,"w":0.32046,"h":0.01212,"fs":0.01151,"n":4,"t":"1. x = 2, y = 3 2. x = -1, z = 0"},{"x":0.53926,"y":0.73642,"w":0.37373,"h":0.01212,"fs":0.01151,"n":6,"t":"17. a. x ≥ 0, y ≥ 0, z = 0 b. x ≥ 0, y ≠ 0, z = 0"},{"x":0.09511,"y":0.74013,"w":0.31104,"h":0.01212,"fs":0.01151,"n":4,"t":"3. y = 0, z = 0 4. x = 1, y = 0"},{"x":0.09511,"y":0.75401,"w":0.35961,"h":0.01615,"fs":0.01151,"n":4,"t":"5. x² + y² = 4, z = 0 6. x² + y² = 4, z = -2"},{"x":0.53926,"y":0.75433,"w":0.38071,"h":0.01212,"fs":0.01151,"n":3,"t":"18. a. 0 ≤ x ≤ 1 b. 0 ≤ x ≤ 1, 0 ≤ y ≤ 1"},{"x":0.09511,"y":0.77191,"w":0.34923,"h":0.01615,"fs":0.01151,"n":4,"t":"7. x² + z² = 4, y = 0 8. y² + z² = 1, x = 0"},{"x":0.56544,"y":0.77223,"w":0.25755,"h":0.01212,"fs":0.01151,"n":3,"t":"c. 0 ≤ x ≤ 1, 0 ≤ y ≤ 1, 0 ≤ z ≤ 1"},{"x":0.53926,"y":0.78611,"w":0.33748,"h":0.01615,"fs":0.01151,"n":2,"t":"19. a. x² + y² + z² ≤ 1 b. x² + y² + z² = 7, x = 0"},{"x":0.09511,"y":0.78982,"w":0.18184,"h":0.01615,"fs":0.01151,"n":2,"t":"9. x² + y² 